# @hub-lanes

# ── CI BATCH RED REPORT (BH-8048) ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Why merge-queue batches go red: one local record per batch run of Harness CI
# (the failing suites, the suites each member's pre-queue gate ran), then
# state/ci-batch-red/latest.tsv and one log line with red_rate= and case=.
# Once a day at 06:37, off the :11/:23/:41/:53 batch-ledger and learned lanes;
# gh_budget_low is asked before each run read. Kill: bin/harness-ctl.sh off ci-batch-red-report.
37 6 * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/ci-batch-red-report.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
